[{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其一 春月","author":"张弼","text":"卷幔閒看月满轮，海棠枝上一钩银。\n黛眉画得浑相似，祗恐嫦娥解妒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30768,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其二 春露","author":"张弼","text":"柳眼花腮湿暗添，无边青紫竞秾纤。\n茂陵谁解相如渴，未赐金茎一滴沾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30769,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其三 春夜","author":"张弼","text":"半亭凉月落花香，剪剪轻风飐烛光。\n杜宇一声春梦醒，乡心千里客愁长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30770,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其四 春昼","author":"张弼","text":"落花飞絮促光阴，倚遍东风伤客心。\n欲试青衫无酒伴，城南草色自深深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30771,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其五 春山","author":"张弼","text":"青染螺鬟春又归，岩花径草霭斜晖。\n谢公自有登山屐，谁向閒门踏藓衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30772,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其六 春柳","author":"张弼","text":"摇曳东风百尺丝，多情浑不系分离。\n明朝走马天涯去，谁向邮城折一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30773,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其七 春燕","author":"张弼","text":"春雨秋风底事忙，栖身自欲向昭阳。\n谁怜江外初归日，巢垒未成空绕梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30774,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其八 春蝶","author":"张弼","text":"曾向滕王画里寻，春园一见动人心。\n东风吹醒南华梦，翘首天涯忆故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30775,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第次姚公绶春兴杂咏韵九首 其九 春草","author":"张弼","text":"带雨和烟色更深，天涯游子思难禁。\n弟兄况隔一千里，梦绕池塘夜夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30776,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访人不值","author":"张弼","text":"茫茫沧海雨浮萍，多谢风波偶合并。\n别后相寻不相见，风波依旧是无情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30777,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月朔雨中对菊","author":"张弼","text":"湿云如梦雨如尘，庭菊抽苗觉渐新。\n试看枝头青蓓蕾，含香有待探花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30778,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅二首次韵 其一","author":"张弼","text":"香满江南数百州，一枝冀北更风流。\n御沟堤上今宵月，添得清光浸玉楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30779,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅二首次韵 其二","author":"张弼","text":"十载含酸待易牙，预将雪艳压春花。\n不容俗客探消息，独倚清风鹤外沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30780,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李贞伯寄索催荷花之作次韵奉酬","author":"张弼","text":"水国芳菲正此时，玉容莫负锦囊诗。\n秋声只在蝉声里，早褪红衣怨阿谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30781,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画松","author":"张弼","text":"大厦连云覆九州，山樗社栎亦旁求。\n道边有个长松树，谁为工师一洗眸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30782,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西浦盟鸥","author":"张弼","text":"吟美清风绿水塘，白鸥时拂茭荷裳。\n年来不独忘机事，一个閒身亦自忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30783,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古祠异迹为王廷秀寺正赋","author":"张弼","text":"千载灵祠异迹存，传葩荐藻自晨昏。\n巫咸有语传神意，只福忠臣孝子门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30784,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭文通画","author":"张弼","text":"水气漫漫浸碧山，奇峰佳木有无间。\n小窗独坐穷周易，不见春风不出关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30785,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分梨词送客","author":"张弼","text":"碧玉盘堆白雪梨，与君举手即分离。\n请君试把梨心嚼，个个心酸知不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30786,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书童志昂诗后","author":"张弼","text":"雪貌霞裾一美人，只将遗佩寄情亲。\n湘皋有路无由见，几度东风草自春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30787,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简王廷贵亚卿","author":"张弼","text":"金陵棋墅旧风流，一著秦师百万休。\n何事先生牢自戒，只将六籍佐皇猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30788,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钟狂客","author":"张弼","text":"狂客别来音信无，定应骑马入皇都。\n岭南尽有佳山水，莫向君王乞鉴湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30789,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儋州载酒堂","author":"张弼","text":"载酒堂前草几青，东坡赢得古今名。\n若教时宰知公论，悔不当初作从伶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30790,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天骏弟小星槎","author":"张弼","text":"玉河东畔小星槎，稳系扶桑看日华。\n吟渴何愁饮无酒，举头东海浩无涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30791,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀天骏第二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"海国茫茫独雁飞，仲宣楼上又斜晖。\n杏园春信催行李，好制燕都远客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30792,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀天骏第二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"倚天长剑重须磨，越砥鹈膏今若何。\n闻道有人占北斗，双龙紫气近尤多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30793,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗袍","author":"张弼","text":"鸭绿罗袍鱼口开，重教补缀不须裁。\n眼前多少鹑衣者，太守真惭袜线才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30794,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴","author":"张弼","text":"平生浑未识丹砂，赤土时将向客誇。\n忽悟自家丹一寸，辰州尤更隔天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30795,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蛇酒","author":"张弼","text":"谁封仲虺醉乡侯，献纳春风百病瘳。\n欲向尊前问消息，当时弓影是邪否。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30796,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五色鹦鹉","author":"张弼","text":"韩子文章百世名，如何亦羡鸟光荣。\n雕笼绣幄香风暖，得似荒山野水情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30797,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"魏受禅碑","author":"张弼","text":"白马之盟久巳寒，大碑深刻尽高官。\n就传典午为文体，莫寄辽东管功安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30798,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姜太守廷器惠竹丝帘","author":"张弼","text":"分得黄堂一丈帘，清风碧沼浪纤纤。\n鹤鸣昼永文书静，不放沉烟出画檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30799,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答琼州李贰守","author":"张弼","text":"长帽仙翁海外归，乾坤随处更忘机。\n阿媻饶舌论春梦，老子从知梦亦非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30800,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠写神者","author":"张弼","text":"随处丹青写我神，故人相见问何人。\n于今百十张东海，只有元来一个真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30801,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"俞舜卿佥宪许柑未送诗以促之","author":"张弼","text":"南海黄柑未见分，举杯空望岭头云。\n元宵灯火相将近，空手归来恼细君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30802,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃行二首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"杜鹃云是古帝魄，臣甫何辞再拜劳。\n却怪天津桥上叫，叫将白眼税青苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30803,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃行二首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"思归长唤不如归，地老天荒知唤谁。\n却喜居庸关上唤，唤将胡骑去如飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30804,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舞剑台送客","author":"张弼","text":"舞剑台前梧叶飞，萧萧凉思欲侵衣。\n天涯万里孤鸿远，且对黄花醉落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30805,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客","author":"张弼","text":"梅岭无梅空有名，凭将何物送君行。\n金鳌阁下横江水，为近源头彻底清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30806,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"张弼","text":"晓行梅岭鹧鸪啼，草树苍凉路欲迷。\n莫道哥哥行不得，马蹄南北又东西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30807,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙茅","author":"张弼","text":"庾岭仙茅旧有名，随时采服可长生。\n使君昨日才持去，今日书来乞墓铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30808,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"张弼","text":"连日雨声今日收，乾坤依旧是清秋。\n高歌莫放行云过，恐作三江百粤愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30809,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讲中庸","author":"张弼","text":"斋居雨坐夜何如，茗盌炉熏听讲书。\n问我旧筌都忘却，一江春水自游鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30810,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友 其一","author":"张弼","text":"懒展残编倚小窗，竹风洒面睡魔降。\n怀人应是人怀我，目断蘼芜燕子双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30811,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送下第友人","author":"张弼","text":"岁月如轮春复春，屈伸何必问苍旻。\n今年得意看花者，多是前年失意人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30812,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其一","author":"张弼","text":"何处竹枝歌一声，片帆渺渺度空明。\n溪桥曲岸人孤立，芳草閒云万种情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30813,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其二","author":"张弼","text":"空濛山色晴还雨，缭绕溪流曲又斜。\n短杖微吟过桥去，东风满路紫藤花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30814,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杭州别驾陈鼎升之任","author":"张弼","text":"苏公堤上柳依依，闻说年来巳半稀。\n君向春风好培植，莫教庭院独芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30815,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天宁寺寻卞郎中华伯不遇","author":"张弼","text":"天宁寺里访诗仙，又蹑飞云过霅川。\n留得新词耀新景，杏花摇艳碧罗天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30816,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳图 其一","author":"张弼","text":"琵琶声断夜如何，应是青衫泪不多。\n谁信当时鲁男子，半窗残烛照双蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49