168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六心菊","author":"张弼","text":"六朝人物六朝心，红紫纷纷满上林。\n输与当时彭泽令，都将收拾付清吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30824,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宵赏灯","author":"张弼","text":"元宵灯火宴西园，旧酒新诗障夜寒。\n纵饮不妨连日醉，白头林下一閒官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30825,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孝子陈思尧归山阴","author":"张弼","text":"万里归来一老身，百年情事始能伸。\n何须浪说辽阳鹤，不及山阴子母亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30826,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵留陈公甫","author":"张弼","text":"分付辎车且莫巾，临川道上有轻尘。\n平生怪煞荆舒老，多读诗书少识人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30827,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别驾陶质夫之京","author":"张弼","text":"雨雪新春甲子晴，鸣笳击鼓发官程。\n禁城到日花如锦，白玉阶前拜圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30828,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事怀彭从吾方伯","author":"张弼","text":"驿路春风催马蹄，独醒人亦醉如泥。\n从吾亭上人千里，独嗅梅花坐日西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30829,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏盆梅","author":"张弼","text":"盆里移来庾岭春，柔枝不称雪精神。\n莫将桃李轻相比，要识留侯似妇人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30830,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漂母祠","author":"张弼","text":"刘伶坟上坐吟风，漂母矶头奠酒钟。\n眼力还高萧相国，能于饿莩识英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30831,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳竞渡","author":"张弼","text":"画鼓红旗送綵舟，健儿八百竞中流。\n谁知有个停桡者，閒倚江山第一楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30832,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读宋史二绝 其一","author":"张弼","text":"女中尧舜岂虚名，惜也垂帘月昼明。\n后世春秋谁秉笔，应将斧钺示仪型。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30833,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读宋史二绝 其二","author":"张弼","text":"一株薜荔二千银，买得中原万里尘。\n纵有龙鳞长风雨，不知艮岳属何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次江员外题壁韵","author":"张弼","text":"绿杨门巷酒旗招，共醉松江月一瓢。\n却被梅花沿路笑，郎君两颊晕红潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏纸鸢送陆文质之京","author":"张弼","text":"百尺东风舞纸鸢，无端声到别离边。\n人生自是无根蒂，却被功名一线牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成","author":"张弼","text":"盘礴乾坤万古心，无由输写强登临。\n蜂房晴日蛙声雨，都付先生自在吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30837,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻南安立生祠","author":"张弼","text":"休说生祠与去思，素餐怀愧已多时。\n归来东海烟霞里，不把浮名白鸟知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30838,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻丘时雍除苏州太守作一绝俟见而呈之否亦当寄也","author":"张弼","text":"我向北来君向南，未知何地接帏幨。\n绿杨啼鸟蓬窗午，先报离情写一函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30839,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦与柳宗畴同游石窦诗以记之俟便乃寄","author":"张弼","text":"梦里同游过水滨，空空石窦碧苔春。\n自无刘阮风流债，不见桃花艳冶人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30840,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮安简呈屠元功主事","author":"张弼","text":"贾生年貌贾生才，圣世浑无绛灌猜。\n自是诗人多水部，嘲吟风月过淮来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30841,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简呈石宗海主事","author":"张弼","text":"清江浦上会同年，笳鼓频催过坝船。\n回首淮南恋风景，淡烟疏雨杏花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30842,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵","author":"张弼","text":"相逢草草惜流年，共醉灯前兰玉船。\n还约木犀花发候，长安珂马共朝天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30843,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沛县寄济宁知州祝廷瑞四首 其一","author":"张弼","text":"沛邑才过望济阳，河流浅涩觉途长。\n故人此际应思我，高咏清风燕寝香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30844,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沛县寄济宁知州祝廷瑞四首 其二","author":"张弼","text":"别后吟髭半染霜，襟怀无复旧时狂。\n琳宫梵宇金台下，回想清游是梦乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30845,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沛县寄济宁知州祝廷瑞四首 其三","author":"张弼","text":"尘编消遣坐蓬窗，不觉春归燕子忙。\n千里黄花无寸草，有情何处嗅花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":30846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]